  {
   "d": "2021-12-07",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We are making good progress on our turnaround and strategic development. While this year is a year of transition, we remain confident in our future prospects.",
   "file": "20211207_BAB_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-02-25",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Overall Group trading for the first ten months to 31 January 2022 was in line with expectations. Results for the Group are fourth quarter weighted, and based on current projections our full year outlook is unchanged.",
   "file": "20220225_BAB_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-28",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "As we look ahead, and as we continue to make operational progress through the disciplined execution of our strategy, the Board is confident of delivering on its expectations of increasingly profitable growth and improved cash flow for FY23.",
   "file": "20220728_BAB_Full-year-results-for-the-year-ended-31-March-2022.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-26",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Trading continues to be in line with the Board's expectations for the full year.",
   "file": "20220926_BAB_AGM-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-11-22",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We expect to see continued operational progress from our focus on execution and growth. We are maintaining our overall financial expectations for the current year.",
   "file": "20221122_BAB_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-04-20",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "Group underlying profitability for FY23 is in line with expectations, excluding the potential one-off impact of the Type 31 contract as outlined below.",
   "file": "20230420_BAB_FY23-post-close-update-and-Type-31-contract-update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-07-20",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Our expectations for FY24 profitability and cash flow are unchanged, although operating cash flow may be weighted to the second half given the FY23 overperformance.",
   "file": "20230720_BAB_Full-year-results-for-the-year-ended-31-March-2023.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-09-28",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "New programme wins, contract renewals and progress on the Group's opportunity pipeline remain strong, supporting the Board's unchanged expectations for another year of organic revenue growth, further underlying margin expansion, improved free cash flow and progress towards the Group's medium-term guidance.",
   "file": "20230928_BAB_AGM-trading-update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-11-14",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "With over 90% of FY24 forecast revenue under contract at the end of September, we enter the second half of the year with good momentum. The Board's expectations for another year of organic revenue growth, further underlying operating margin expansion and positive cash flow generation are unchanged, and we continue to build momentum to achieve the medium term guidance set out within our FY23 results.",
   "file": "20231114_BAB_Results-for-the-six-months-ended-30-September-2023.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-07-17",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Guidance unchanged: we expect a further year of progress in FY25 and reiterate our medium term guidance",
   "file": "20240717_BAB_FY24-results-update-and-Type-31-contract-update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-07-26",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Our expectations for FY25 remain unchanged. With c.70% of FY25 expected revenue under contract at 1 April 2024, we enter the year strongly positioned with good momentum and are confident of making further progress against our medium-term guidance",
   "file": "20240726_BAB_Full-year-results-for-the-year-ended-31-March-2024.md"
  },
